+The `mgis_bv_BatchRotationDataView` structure gives the number of points,
+the rotated values, the values to be rotated, which may be the rotated
+values, and the rotation matrices from the global frame to the material
+frame. Each rotation matrix has 9 components stored in column-major
+format, as for the `generic` interface. The rotation matrix is uniform if
+the point stride of its field is null. The computations are submitted to
+the queue given by the execution options of the structure.
 
